DERIVED VOCABULARY — ATTRIBUTION

`tools/gsm_items.py` (the item lexicon) and the verb catalogue in
`tools/gen_genesis_verbs.py` are DERIVED by census from the grade-school
word problem suites in the architecture repository, which are themselves
adapted from GSM8K:

    GSM8K — Training Verifiers to Solve Math Word Problems
    Cobbe et al., OpenAI, 2021. MIT License.
    https://github.com/openai/grade-school-math

What is derived is a vocabulary — single words that pass two
independent witnesses — and not any problem text. The corpus is checked
against verbatim reuse by `bench/adapters/leak_court.py` in the
architecture repository, whose frontier is zero and which reports 0
leaked cases of 468.

WHAT THE PROSE WORLDS ARE

The manifest declares seven PROSE worlds (msfs, uhm, mf, diakrisis,
verum) that are NOT contained in this repository: they are built by the
architecture repository's own pipeline and are resolved through the
declared `external_root`. Their licensing follows that repository.
